286
00:14:43.621 --> 00:14:45.101
Strange.

287
00:14:53.849 --> 00:14:54.894
Well. I'm...

288
00:14:55.590 --> 00:14:57.505
I'm really sorry. and
I'm sorry about the...

289
00:14:58.636 --> 00:15:00.159
blueberry mix-up.

290
00:15:00.160 --> 00:15:01.596
It's okay.

291
00:15:07.950 --> 00:15:10.734
When I die. I want to
