affairs with other women.

380
00:18:47.213 --> 00:18:49.388
I worry that Joseph's
wife. Emma Smith.

381
00:18:49.389 --> 00:18:51.607
was upset when he
slept with Fanny Alger.

382
00:18:51.608 --> 00:18:54.307
