I think strengthened it.

454
00:21:37.339 --> 00:21:38.906
do you know what I found?

455
00:21:40.777 --> 00:21:43.998
The more you know.
the less you know.

456
00:21:46.609 --> 00:21:49.263
And by the time I was
50. I was malnourished

457
00:21:49.264 --> 00:21:52.614
