466
00:22:20.904 --> 00:22:22.645
But unfortunately. I did.

467
00:22:34.004 --> 00:22:36.484
Can we meet your wife?

468
00:22:36.485 --> 00:22:37.964
Please?

469
00:22:37.965 --> 00:22:40.532
Of course. yes!

470
00:22:40.533 --> 00:22:43.709
She just has to be
present. and we want

471
00:22:43.710 --> 00:22:45.581
