1336
01:23:08.809 --> 01:23:10.028
Yeah.

1337
01:23:11.464 --> 01:23:12.812
Oh. yeah.

1338
01:23:12.813 --> 01:23:14.859
Oh. yeah.

1339
01:23:18.210 --> 01:23:19.298
Yep.

1340
01:23:20.038 --> 01:23:21.126
Yep.

1341
