1544
01:37:53.824 --> 01:37:57.654
It is called drinking
the... anyone?

1545
01:37:59.482 --> 01:38:00.830
Kool-Aid.

1546
01:38:00.831 --> 01:38:01.919
It is true...

1547
01:38:02.485 --> 01:38:04.921
