ladies a little chilly.

1548
01:38:04.922 --> 01:38:06.444
and a little peckish.

1549
01:38:06.445 --> 01:38:08.045
for which I am very
sorry. Sorry. ladies.

1550
01:38:08.534 --> 01:38:10.361
But only for the same reason

1551
01:38:10.362 --> 01:38:11.841
